# Milestone: M3
# Covers: scopeTag with explicit tag label kills ',' strands when function
#         exits; without scopeTag the comma strand outlives the function call.
# defer-to: M5 (requires scopeTag builtin, every keyword, and ',' separator runtime)
#
# Reason:
#   Same as scope-tag.chk: requires scopeTag builtin (M5) and ',' separator
#   (M5 chk driver).  This variant additionally verifies the absence-of-scopeTag
#   case where the detached strand continues past function exit.
#
# Original urbiscript (activate at M5 with scopeTag + M5 chk driver):
# # function f() { { var t = scopeTag; t: { sleep(2s); echo("foo") }, echo("bar"); sleep(1s); echo("baz") }; sleep(2s); echo("xyzzy") } | f();
# # [00000001] *** bar
# # ... (see legacy/repos/aldebaran-urbi/tests/2.x/scope-tag2.chk)
